scn 1
# Passing within a small click (2026-11-16; tools/legion_overtake_test.py): knights at the rear of a block,
# two rows of 4 slow 2x2 bodies (1.10) ahead of two rows of 3 fast 3x3 ones (2.9), one right-click to a point about
# 500 px from the click's centre. Asset-free, open field.
name overtake-click-rear-500
ticks 4000
players 1
weapons off
map flat 128 160
type slow mover 2 2500 1 1.10
type mid mover 2 2500 1 1.9
type fast mover 3 2500 1 2.9
group S1 0 slow 4 rect 54 80 74 84 pitch=4
group S2 0 slow 4 rect 54 86 74 90 pitch=4
group F1 0 fast 3 rect 54 92 74 96 pitch=6
group F2 0 fast 3 rect 54 98 74 102 pitch=6
at 5 move S1,S2,F1,F2 64 60
